{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"id-generator","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"ID Generator","description":"Insert UUID v4 and v7, ULID, NanoID, short ids and MongoDB ObjectIds, in bulk if you want, and check what an id is and when it was made.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Tools"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","main":"extension.js","activationEvents":["onCommand:idGenerator.insert","onCommand:idGenerator.uuid","onCommand:idGenerator.uuid7","onCommand:idGenerator.ulid","onCommand:idGenerator.nanoid","onCommand:idGenerator.inspect"],"permissions":[],"contributes":{"commands":[{"command":"idGenerator.insert","title":"Insert IDs...","category":"ID Generator"},{"command":"idGenerator.uuid","title":"Insert UUID v4","category":"ID Generator"},{"command":"idGenerator.uuid7","title":"Insert UUID v7 (sortable)","category":"ID Generator"},{"command":"idGenerator.ulid","title":"Insert ULID","category":"ID Generator"},{"command":"idGenerator.nanoid","title":"Insert NanoID","category":"ID Generator"},{"command":"idGenerator.inspect","title":"What Is This ID?...","category":"ID Generator"}],"keybindings":[{"command":"idGenerator.uuid","key":"Ctrl+Alt+U"}],"configuration":{"title":"ID Generator","properties":{"idGenerator.nanoidLength":{"type":"number","default":21,"description":"Length of a NanoID (4 to 64)."}}}}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"extension.js":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"// ID Generator: UUID v4 and v7, ULID, NanoID, short ids and ObjectIDs, inserted at the cursor, and a checker.\n\nfunction bytes(n) {\n  return crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint8Array(n));\n}\nconst hex = (b) => [...b].map((x) => x.toString(16).padStart(2, '0')).join('');\n\nfunction uuid4() {\n  const b = bytes(16);\n  b[6] = (b[6] & 0x0f) | 0x40;\n  b[8] = (b[8] & 0x3f) | 0x80;\n  const h = hex(b);\n  return h.slice(0, 8) + '-' + h.slice(8, 12) + '-' + h.slice(12, 16) + '-' + h.slice(16, 20) + '-' + h.slice(20);\n}\n\n/** UUID v7: 48 bits of Unix milliseconds, then random bits. They sort by creation time. */\nfunction uuid7(now = Date.now()) {\n  const b = bytes(16);\n  let t = BigInt(now);\n  for (let i = 5; i >= 0; i--) {\n    b[i] = Number(t & 0xffn);\n    t >>= 8n;\n  }\n  b[6] = (b[6] & 0x0f) | 0x70;\n  b[8] = (b[8] & 0x3f) | 0x80;\n  const h = hex(b);\n  return h.slice(0, 8) + '-' + h.slice(8, 12) + '-' + h.slice(12, 16) + '-' + h.slice(16, 20) + '-' + h.slice(20);\n}\n\nconst CROCKFORD = '0123456789ABCDEFGHJKMNPQRSTVWXYZ';\n/** ULID: 10 characters of time, 16 of randomness, sortable. */\nfunction ulid(now = Date.now()) {\n  let t = now;\n  let time = '';\n  for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\n    time = CROCKFORD[t % 32] + time;\n    t = Math.floor(t / 32);\n  }\n  const r = bytes(16);\n  let rand = '';\n  for (let i = 0; i < 16; i++) rand += CROCKFORD[r[i] % 32];\n  return time + rand;\n}\n\nconst URL_ALPHABET = 'useandom-26T198340PX75pxJACKVERYMINDBUSHWOLF_GQZbfghjklqvwyzrict';\nfunction nanoid(size = 21, alphabet = URL_ALPHABET) {\n  // Rejection sampling keeps every character equally likely.\n  const mask = (2 << (31 - Math.clz32((alphabet.length - 1) | 1))) - 1;\n  let id = '';\n  while (id.length < size) {\n    for (const b of bytes(size * 2)) {\n      const i = b & mask;\n      if (i < alphabet.length) id += alphabet[i];\n      if (id.length === size) break;\n    }\n  }\n  return id;\n}\n\nfunction objectId(now = Date.now()) {\n  return Math.floor(now / 1000).toString(16).padStart(8, '0') + hex(bytes(8));\n}\n\nfunction describe(text) {\n  const s = text.trim();\n  if (/^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-([1-8])[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i.test(s)) {\n    const v = Number(s[14]);\n    let extra = '';\n    if (v === 7) extra = ', created ' + new Date(parseInt(s.replace(/-/g, '').slice(0, 12), 16)).toISOString();\n    return 'UUID version ' + v + extra;\n  }\n  if (/^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i.test(s)) return 'UUID shape, but the version or variant bits are unusual';\n  if (/^[0-9A-HJKMNP-TV-Z]{26}$/i.test(s)) {\n    let t = 0;\n    for (const ch of s.slice(0, 10).toUpperCase()) t = t * 32 + CROCKFORD.indexOf(ch);\n    return 'ULID, created ' + new Date(t).toISOString();\n  }\n  if (/^[0-9a-f]{24}$/i.test(s)) return 'MongoDB ObjectId, created ' + new Date(parseInt(s.slice(0, 8), 16) * 1000).toISOString();\n  return 'Not a UUID, ULID or ObjectId';\n}\n\nconst KINDS = {\n  'UUID v4 (random)': () => uuid4(),\n  'UUID v7 (sortable by time)': () => uuid7(),\n  'ULID (sortable, 26 characters)': () => ulid(),\n  'NanoID (21 characters, URL safe)': () => nanoid(21),\n  'Short ID (8 letters and digits)': () => nanoid(8, '0123456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz'),\n  'MongoDB ObjectId': () => objectId(),\n};\n\nexports._test = { uuid4, uuid7, ulid, nanoid, objectId, describe, KINDS };\n\nexports.activate = function (context) {\n  context.subscriptions.push(\n    ferrum.commands.register('idGenerator.insert', async () => {\n      const kind = await ferrum.window.showQuickPick(Object.keys(KINDS), { placeholder: 'Which kind of id?' });\n      if (!kind) return;\n      const text = await ferrum.window.showInputBox({ prompt: 'How many? (one per line)', value: '1' });\n      const n = Math.max(1, Math.min(500, Math.floor(Number(text)) || 1));\n      const out = [];\n      for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) out.push(KINDS[kind]());\n      await ferrum.editor.insert(out.join('\\n'));\n    }),\n    ferrum.commands.register('idGenerator.uuid', async () => ferrum.editor.insert(uuid4())),\n    ferrum.commands.register('idGenerator.uuid7', async () => ferrum.editor.insert(uuid7())),\n    ferrum.commands.register('idGenerator.ulid', async () => ferrum.editor.insert(ulid())),\n    ferrum.commands.register('idGenerator.nanoid', async () => ferrum.editor.insert(nanoid(Math.max(4, Math.min(64, Number(ferrum.settings.get('idGenerator.nanoidLength')) || 21))))),\n    ferrum.commands.register('idGenerator.inspect', async () => {\n      const doc = await ferrum.editor.active();\n      let t = doc && doc.selectedText ? doc.selectedText : '';\n      if (!t) t = (await ferrum.window.showInputBox({ prompt: 'Paste an id to check' })) || '';\n      if (t) ferrum.window.showMessage(describe(t));\n    }),\n  );\n};\n\nexports.deactivate = function () {};\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# ID Generator\n\nIds come from the system's secure random generator.\n\n| Kind | Looks like | Good for |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| UUID v4 | `3b241101-e2bb-4255-8caf-4136c566a962` | Random ids everywhere |\n| UUID v7 | `018c2e7a-...` | Database keys: they sort by creation time |\n| ULID | `01HGW2X5Z8...` | Sortable, 26 characters, no dashes |\n| NanoID | `V1StGXR8_Z5jdHi6B-myT` | Short URL safe ids |\n| ObjectId | `655b1b00a1b2c3d4e5f60718` | MongoDB |\n\n**Insert IDs...** asks for the kind and how many (one per line, up to 500). **What Is This ID?...** tells you the kind of an id and, for v7, ULID and ObjectId, the date it was created.\n\nCtrl+Alt+U inserts a UUID v4. No permissions needed.\n"}}}